---
fileType: Question Text
version: CSPro 7.7
languages:
  - name: EN
    label: English
  - name: FR
    label: French
  - name: KISWAHILI
    label: KISWAHILI
styles:
  - name: Normal
    className: normal
    css: |
      font-family: Arial;font-size: 16px;
  - name: Instruction
    className: instruction
    css: |
      font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px;color: #0000FF;
  - name: Heading 1
    className: heading1
    css: |
      font-family: Arial;font-size: 36px;
  - name: Heading 2
    className: heading2
    css: |
      font-family: Arial;font-size: 24px;
  - name: Heading 3
    className: heading3
    css: |
      font-family: Arial;font-size: 18px;
questions:
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.NAME
    conditions:
      - logic: curocc()=1
        questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>What is the name of the head of the household?</p><p></p>
      - logic: curocc() >= 2
        questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>What is the name of the next member of the household?</p><p></p>
      - {}
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.SEX
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>Is  ~~NAME~~ a male or a female?</p><p></p>
          FR: |
            ~~NAME~~ est-il un homme ou une femme ?<p></p>
          KISWAHILI: |
            Jinsia ya mtu huyu ni ipi?<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.RELATIONSHIP
    conditions:
      - logic: curocc()=1
        questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>&nbsp;~~NAME~~ is the head of the household?</p><p></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p>
      - logic: curocc()>=2
        questionText:
          EN: |
            &nbsp;what is ~~NAME~~ relationship to the household head?<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.AGE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>Ho<span class="instruction">﻿</span>w <span class="instruction">﻿</span>old is  ~~NAME~~ in completed years?</p><p><b><u><i><span class="instruction">Enter age in completed years ("000" for</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;" class="instruction">﻿</span><span class="instruction">&nbsp;children less than one year old)</span></i></u></b></p><p><span class="heading2">﻿</span><br></p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.MARITAL_STATUS
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>What is the marital status of ~~NAME~~?&nbsp;</p><p><p></p></p>
          FR: |
            <p>Quel est l’état matrimonial de ~~NAME~~ ?</p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.PRACTICE_REGION
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            in which region were you born?<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.PLACE_OF_BIRTH
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            in which county were you born?<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.RESIDENCE_1YR
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            which county did you reside in one year ago<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.DISABILITIES
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            do you have any disabilities?<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.CITIZENSHIP
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            what is your citizenship status<u> <b><i>currently</i></b></u><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.LANGUAGES_SPOKEN
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            which languages do ~~NAME~~ speak<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.MAIN_LANGUAGE
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            which is ~~NAME~~ main language<p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.TYPE_OF_MAIN_DWELLING
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>&nbsp;</p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.NAME_OF_DECEASED
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <br><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.DEATH_RELATIONSHIP
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>what is the relationship of&nbsp; ~~getocclabel()~~ with the household head?<span class="instruction normal">﻿</span></p><p></p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.CHILDREN_DIED
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>How many children have died? Based on your previous answers, the calculated number of children who died is ~~calculatedChildrenDied~~</p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.ASSET_NAME
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            <p>What asset does the household own?</p><p><br></p><p></p>
  - name: POPSTAN2020_DICT.QUANTITY
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN: |
            How many ~~ASSET_NAME~~ does this household own?<p></p>
